# The login again from the login screen (UI-02: after character select's Previous or the quit menu's Quit to
# Login): the fields (_login_live_type), the login button, character select's avatar list. Not run on its own.
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 30
include _login_live_type
click gadget login.ok
wait-event antprox 'GLOBAL_AVATAR_LIST' within 30
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 40
